{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc89","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06f47-b5dc-78b1-af70-be0816a3d708"},"sequence":1183,"recorded_at":1780531400002361,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"42f9cffc-ec0a-425b-8f55-554017895831"},"task_id":"42f9cffc-ec0a-425b-8f55-554017895831","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"42f9cffc-ec0a-425b-8f55-554017895831","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 479-482\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-rollback-token entropy floor is pinned at exactly 31 refused / 32 accepted\n-decoded bytes, both frame-size bounds are pinned at exactly limit refused /\n-limit accepted from both directions, and the operation registry is pinned\n-against the Section 7.5 table in order.\n+rollback-token entropy floor is pinned at exactly 31 refused / 32 accepted\n+decoded bytes, both frame-size bounds are pinned at exactly limit refused /\n+limit accepted from both directions, and the operation registry is pinned\n+against the Section 7.5 table in order. Refusal arms are derived from\n+production source rather than listed: every frameFault literal,\n+integrity detail, and parseMajor classification branch must carry a\n+witness at the production entry, and every witness must name a derived\n+arm, so a planted arm or a deleted branch reddens in either direction.\n+stdoutCap is pinned at MaxFrameBytes+2 in both directions, with a\n+maximal-frame-plus-junk probe through the production runner proving the\n+probe byte is load-bearing.\n"}}}
