{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ce0f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06f47-b5dc-78b1-af70-be0816a3d708"},"sequence":1378,"recorded_at":1780531400002751,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"ea5d7938-e462-4f09-a6ee-0a79f072fa57"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Round 3 rework is ready for review (`to-review`, no commit per the change-request shape — rework left in the working tree).\n\nWhat changed (test-only, no production edits):\n\n- **G-A mechanism** — new [refusal_arm_inventory_test.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3jqsx1/worktree/internal/provhost/refusal_arm_inventory_test.go): derives 60 arms from production AST (frameFault literals keyed by detail+member source, integrity details with the wrapper expanded over the decodeStrictObject fault set only, parseMajor branches keyed by enclosing condition, literal constructor calls). Fail-closed on empty/short/unparseable derivation plus a 60-arm census floor; both directions checked (forward + reverse orphan detection); every witness driven through the production entry. Result: 60/60 witnessed.\n- **F30** — four `a.0.0`-class rows (`a`, `2a`, `-1`, `+3` majors with numeric rest) in the main refusal table plus parse-branch witnesses asserting exit 13.\n- **F31** — `TestStdoutCapIsPinned` (both directions) plus a maximal-frame-plus-junk probe through real `ExecRunner` + `Host.Call`.\n- **Smalls** — X19 non-string operation_id row; `status_state` asserted on all 20 integrity witnesses via a new `requireIntegrityRefusal` helper (separate from `requireLocalRefusal`, which also serves stateless codes); group-kill comment corrected to measured latency with U2 recorded as unknown on macOS.\n\nVerification I ran myself: `go build`, `go vet`, `GOOS=windows go vet`, `gofmt` clean, `go test ./...` all 15 packages green, provhost cover 88.4%, `-race` clean, tracecheck unchanged (17/403, 74 cases). Mutant battery: 9/9 red as required (M23 with the exact exit-6 flip signature, S4-narrow with `got nil` acceptance, S4b-wide via the pin, G1/G3 via the forward check, M22 via both directions, X19), each presence-confirmed and restored byte-identical; production grep confirms nothing lingers. Evidence attached as `TASK-260830-qcosxq_round3-evidence.md`.","reason":null}}
